<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1JN" style="id">- Bekwel Bible 5</book>
  <para style="h">Mɛkana ɛ Zaŋ, yii Mɛkɛn</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mɛkana ɛ Zaŋ yii Mɛkɛn</para>
  <para style="toc2">Zaŋ yii Mɛkɛn</para>
  <para style="toc3">1Za</para>
  <para style="mt2">Mɛkana ɛ Zaŋ, yii Mɛkɛn</para>
  <para style="mt1">Zaŋ Mɛkɛn</para>
  <para style="imt">Ɛniel</para>
  <para style="ip">Ye nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ bɔɔ mɛkana mɛlɛl ee mɛ Zaŋ nakyaal nɛ bot nadi tɔ bɛdhiiti eghaada ɛ. Tɔ sama bɛmɛkana menek, mɛkana mɛkɛn ààlyaal din ɛ mot nakwyal mɛkana mɛ tak ɔ. Mot nakwyal mɛkana mɛ bhɔɔba nɛ mɛkana mɛ mɛsik ɔ, ye ɛ́ «Paa». Nyɛ ɛ́ mot di djɛɛd zɛɛga ndjaa mendjaala ɔ, bot ɛ nyɛ di ekwyal bɛmɛkana ɔ nɛ kaab nyɛ.</para>
  <para style="ip">Tɔ mɛkana mɛ mɛkɛn, din ɛ mot mɛkana di ekwyalaa étɛp ɔ, ààgua. Mɛkana mɛ bhɔɔba kwyalaa ɛ nɛ «Moma Zɛɛb nasɛɛ ɔ dɔɔ nɛ bɔɔ bɛ», ye kwyɛl ɛlɛɛ, zɛɛga ndjaa mendjaala ye ekeletyɛ dɔɔ nɛ bot bɛ. Mɛkana mɛ elɛl, ye nakwyalaa ɛ etɛp keletyɛ wat nɛ din ɛ Ghayis. Nyɛ wat tɔ sama bot ɛ zɛɛga ndjaa mendjaala, pɛ ekeletyɛ di nɛ etɛp pak'ɔɔ ɔ.</para>
  <para style="ip">Bɛmɛkana mɛlɛl mak kwyalaa ɛ étɛp ezɛɛga ndjaa mendjaala, bot ɛ di egu Mbɛɛ Bhaadal ɛ Zaŋ ɛnyɔɛpe ɔ. Ye moo mos ɛ nɛ bɛtɛ nɛ membu bhis bɛ nagoola Mbɛɛ Bhaadal e mɛkɛn «tɔɔɔ» ɛ Yezu Klisto ɛ. Bɛdhiiti ekeletyɛ nalaa Mbɛɛ Bhaadal ɛ Zaŋ tak ɔ, bɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààmyaala nɛ esa djas bɛ nagwak tɔ mɛkana mɛ. Bɛdhiiti nadus tɔ ezɛɛga mendjaa mɛ mendjaala mɔɔ. Bak bot eekus ɛzɛm pak'ɔɔ. Bɛ ààkwyɛl ɛmyaal náá, Yezu nazyɛ kɔ bɔs ɛ dáa bot djas di zoozyɛ ɛ́. Tin, bɛ tok nɛ gwyes ɛ Yezu: Tsik'ɛ nɛ ɛsyee ɛ lɛ e mis mɔɔ toto. Bɛ ke ɛ náá: «Bis tok nɛ mesyem», «Bis nɛ gu Zɛɛb» nɛghu «Bis ɛ tɔ mengel». Tin, tsik'ɔ lyaal ɛ sa sis.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mot nakwyal bɛmɛkana mɛ tak ɔ, ɛpedul ekeletyɛ mɛlɔ étɛp bɛ needi ààgwak elɛŋ etsal ee bot di elɛɛ bɛ dum Yezu nɛghu Zɛɛb ɔ. Tinaak, tɛtɛ bɔɔ Zɛɛb ke ɛ náá, Yezu Klisto nazyɛ kɔ bɔs ɛ dáa bot djas di ezyɛ ɛ́. Bot di ààmyaal náá ye ɛ́ deenek ɔ, bɛ ɛ́ bot ɛ mɛbhuka ɛ Yezu. Bot ɛ zedum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɔ goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛdi ɛ́ sosoob nɛ Mbɛɛ Bhaadal bɛ nakwak e mɛkɛn «tɔɔɔ» ɛ. Mbɛɛ Bhaadal tak lɛɛ: ɛkwyɛl Zɛɛb nɛ ɛkwyɛl Yezu, ye ɛ́ ɛkwyɛl ɛ bɔɔ bɛsɔ. Kyeed e ekeletyɛ di ekɛ ɛ goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛlyaal dáa ɛdum ɛ koŋ ɛ lɔɔ di ɛ.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1JN 1"/>
  <para style="s">Mɛkpa mɛ tsik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1JN 1:1"/>Esa ee nadi e mɛkɛn «tɔɔɔ» ɛ, mena naazegwak yɛ, naabee yɛ nɛ mis, mena naabee nɛ ɛmɛt yɛ nɛ mɛmbɔ menaka. Ye nabɛ ɛ́ mɛkpa mɛ di esa náá, mot di nɛ tsik ɛ. <verse eid="1JN 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1JN 1:2"/>Zɛɛb naalyaal bot náá, mot tak ɛ mot di edjɛ tsik ɔ, bis naabee yɛ. Bis ɛ bɛtyaasɛs etɛp bɛ, étɛp tak ɛ bis di egoola bin tsik na kɔm-kɔm nadi tɔ Zɛɛb Sɛɛg ɛ. Ye ɛ́ nyɛy Zɛɛb ɛ natel bis ye ɛ́. <verse eid="1JN 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1JN 1:3"/>Sa bis nabee nɛ ɛgwak ɛ, bis ɛpegoola bin ye ɛ́, etɛɛ náá, bi needi sama nɛ nes tɔ ɛgwakel ee bis di nɛ yɛ nɛ Zɛɛb Sɛɛg dɔɔ nɛ mɔn'ɛ Yezu Klisto ɛ. <verse eid="1JN 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1JN 1:4"/>E di'enek, bis kwyal etɛp bak ɛ etɛɛ náá, mɛmyaala mis needjala.<verse eid="1JN 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Zɛɛb ɛ́ mɛkas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1JN 1:5"/>Bhaadal bis nagwak nɛ Yezu Klisto, da bis ɛgoola bin ɛ, ye ɛ́ náá, Zɛɛb ɛ́ mɛkas, ye tok nɛ ghooghom tɔ lɛ. <verse eid="1JN 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1JN 1:6"/>Mena keka náá, menaka ɛ́ nɛ ɛgwakel nɛ Zɛɛb, e di'enek, da mena baadi ekekɛka tɔ ghooghom ɔɔ. Tin, menaka ɛ́ bot ɛ etsal, etsɛɛtsɛ tok tɔ lena. <verse eid="1JN 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1JN 1:7"/>Zɛɛb ɛ́ mɛkas. Tin, menabɛlka djas ɛ di ekɛ tɔ gwyɛ ngel dáa Zɛɛb nyɛy nyɛ ɛmet di ekɛ ɔɔ, menaka ɛ́ tɔ ɛgwakel pak'enaka. E di'enek, ghiya ɛ Yezu, mɔn'ɛ waadis mena edhuud e mesyem djas.<verse eid="1JN 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1JN 1:8"/>Mena keka náá, mena tokeka nɛ mesyem ɔɔ, mena eekɔɔka mɛnyel mena met. Tin, etsɛɛtsɛ tok tɔ lena. <verse eid="1JN 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1JN 1:9"/>E di'enek, mena vaa mesyem mena pɛ daa Zɛɛb ɔɔ, mena ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛdi nɛ ɛbwaalel etɛɛ náá nyɛ ɛ́ mot epiki nɛ esosoob. Nyɛ waapel mesyem mena, nɛ ɛdis mena edhuud embee etɛp djas. <verse eid="1JN 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1JN 1:10"/>Mena keka náá, mena ààpasyemka ɔɔ, guka náá, mena eesaka náá, Zɛɛb di mot etsal. Tin, mɛkpa mɛ tok tɔ lena.<verse eid="1JN 1:10"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1JN 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1JN 2"/>
  <para style="s">Klisto ɛpezyɛ étɛp ɛzɛkwyee mena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1JN 2:1"/>Bɔɔ bam, mɛ kwyal bin etɛp bak ɛ ekaab náá, bi ɛzɛkɛsyem. Tin, mot ɛ syem ɔɔ, menaka ɛ́ nɛ mot ghɛm engwoob Zɛɛb Sɛɛg'ena: ye ɛ́ Yezu Klisto mot epiki. <verse eid="1JN 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1JN 2:2"/>Nyɛy ɛ́ naka nyel'ɛ buwa étɛp ɛpelak mesyem mena. Ye tok etɛp mesyem nɛ mesyem mena met. Ye ɛ́ dɔɔ nɛ mesyem mɛ bot ɛ bɔs djas.<verse eid="1JN 2:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1JN 2:3"/>Mena di eduwalka mɛtiŋ mɛ Zɛɛb ɔɔ, mena nɛ ghwyil dika nɛ ɛbwaalel náá, mena nɛ guka Zɛɛb. <verse eid="1JN 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1JN 2:4"/>Mot ɛ́ ke náá: «Mɛ nɛ gu Zɛɛb ɔ», da nyɛ kadi ɛ́ ààduwal mɛtiŋ mɛ ɔɔ, nyɛ ɛ́ mot etsal, etsɛɛtsɛ tok tɔ lɛ. <verse eid="1JN 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1JN 2:5"/>Yɛ kabɛ náá, mot ɛpeduwal mɛkpa mɛ Zɛɛb ɔɔ. Yenɔk tak nɛ kwyɛl Zɛɛb nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ. Ye ɛ́ deenek ɛ mena aaguka náá, menaka ɛ́ sama wat nɛ Zɛɛb. <verse eid="1JN 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1JN 2:6"/>Mot ɛ di eke náá, nyɛ ɛ́ tɔ ɛgwakel nɛ Zɛɛb ɔɔ, nyɛ goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛkɛ dáa Yezu.<verse eid="1JN 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mɛtiŋ mɛ na bes</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1JN 2:7"/>Bɔn nyɛɛg bam mɛ di ekwyɛl ɔ, ɛtiŋ ɛ mɛ di ekwyal bin wak'ak tok ɛtsiŋ ɛ na bes. Ye ɛ́ ɛtsiŋ ɛ namwa, bi nazegwak e mɛkɛn «tɔɔɔ» ɛ. Ɛtsiŋ ɛ namwa tak ɛ, mɛkpa mɛ bi nazegwak ɛ. <verse eid="1JN 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1JN 2:8"/>Bela náá, yii mɛ kabaadi ekwyal bin kwyala sis'aak ɛ ɛtiŋ na bes. Etsɛɛtsɛ e tak nyen ɛ tɔ tsik ɛ Klisto. Etɛp tak ɛ ɛpebaanyen tɔ tsik'en, etɛɛ náá, ghooghom ɛpetɔ́ nɛ ɛsi, tɛtɛ gwyɛ ngel moo kan ɛnyen.<verse eid="1JN 2:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1JN 2:9"/>Deenek, mot di ke náá, nyɛ tɔ gwyɛ ngel, da nyɛ kadi ɛ́ ebhina mɔn nyɛɛg'ɔɔ, nyɛ dinaa ɛ tɔ ghooghom. <verse eid="1JN 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1JN 2:10"/>Mot di ekwyɛl mɔn nyɛɛg'ɔɔ, nyɛ ɛ́ tɔ gwyɛ ngel, ye tok nɛ dhiiti sonok aadul nyɛ tɔ syem. <verse eid="1JN 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1JN 2:11"/>Tin, mot ɛ́ di ebhina mɔn nyɛɛg'ɔɔ, nyɛ ɛ́ tɔ ghooghom. E di'enek, nyɛ ɛpekɛ tɔ ghooghom ààgu pɛ kyee nyɛ di etɔ́ ɛ, etɛɛ náá, ghooghom eezenɛɛg mot edhim.<verse eid="1JN 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1JN 2:12"/>Bɔɔ bam, mɛ kwyal bin mɛkana mak ɛ etɛɛ náá, mesyem min eezepelaa kɔ ɛsu ɛ din ɛ Yezu Klisto.<verse eid="1JN 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1JN 2:13"/>Biyɔ bɛpaa, mɛ kwyal bin mɛkana mak ɛ etɛɛ náá, bi nɛ gu mot nadi e mɛkɛn «tɔɔɔ» ɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1JN 2:13">Mengbaaz, mɛ kwyal bin mɛkana mak ɛ etɛɛ náá, bi naazekwak Mbee Mot.<verse eid="1JN 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1JN 2:14"/>Bɔɔ bam, mɛ kwyal bin mɛkana mak ɛ etɛɛ náá, bi nɛ gu Zɛɛb Sɛɛg.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1JN 2:14">Bɛpaa, mɛ kwyal bin mɛkana mak ɛ, etɛɛ náá bi nɛ gu mot nadi e mɛkɛn «tɔɔɔ» ɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1JN 2:14">Biyɔ mengbaaz, mɛ kwyal bin mɛkana mak ɛ etɛɛ náá, bi ɛ nɛ ghwyil, mɛkpa mɛ Zɛɛb ɛ tɔ len, bi eezekwak Mbee Mot.<verse eid="1JN 2:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1JN 2:15"/>Nàwaka lyem tɔ mbee tsik e bot ɛ bɔs'ak nɛ mbee esesɛɛ e bɔs'ak. Tin, mot ɛ di ewa lyem tɔ mbee esesɛɛ e bɔs'ak ɔɔ, nyɛ tok nɛ ghwyil kwyɛl Zɛɛb Sɛɛg. <verse eid="1JN 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1JN 2:16"/>Beeka esa dinaa ye ɛ́ yii tsik bɔs ɛ: egwyes ɛsa sa lyem di ekwos ɛ, nɛghu gwyes ɛbela esa djas di beeaa nɛ mis ɛ, zɛnɔɔ ɛbet kɔ ɛsu ɛ esa e bɔs. Deenek, etɛp binek djas ààdus pɛ daa Zɛɛb Sɛɛg, ye dus ɛ tɔ mbee esesɛɛ e bɔs. <verse eid="1JN 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1JN 2:17"/>Ghuna etɛp e bɔs ɛpetɔ́ pɛ mɛ mɛsik, nɛ embee egwyes bɛ. Tin, mot di esa ɛkwosak ɛ Zɛɛb ɔ, nyɛ aadi ɛ́ nɛ tsik na kɔm-kɔm.<verse eid="1JN 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mot ɛ mɛbhuka ɛ Klisto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1JN 2:18"/>Bɔɔ bam, bot moo wak ɛ e ɛwala mɛ mɛsik! Bi naazegwak náá, mot mɛbhuka ɛ Klisto ɛpezyɛ. Ghuna, e mɛwala mɛ bot dika mos'aak, bɛtɛ nɛ bot ɛ mɛbhuka ɛ Klisto eezetuula. Ye kwyɛl ɛlɛɛ ɛ, bot moo ɛ́ e ɛwala mɛ mɛsik. <verse eid="1JN 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1JN 2:19"/>Nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ, bot ɛ mɛbhuka ɛ Klisto tak nabɛ ɛ́ ààbɛ bot bis, étɛp tak ɛ bɛ nadul mɛnyel mɔɔ tɔ les tɔ́ yɔbɔ. Etɛɛ náá, bɛ ɛpedi ɛdi bot bina ɔɔ, pe bɛ naadi bis nɛ bɛ nɔɔ. Ye ɛ́ deenek ɛ ye nasael étɛp ye neenyen náá, mot ngɔt tɔ lɔɔ nabɛ ɛ́ ààbɛ bis nɛ bɛ nɔɔ. <verse eid="1JN 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1JN 2:20"/>Yɛ kabɛ biyɔ ɔɔ, bi naazebela Sisim na Dɛɛ ee Klisto nadjɛ ɛ, etɛɛ náá, biyɔ djas neegu etsɛɛtsɛ. <verse eid="1JN 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1JN 2:21"/>Yɛ bɛ náá, mɛ eekwyal bin mɛkana mak ɔɔ, ye tok etɛɛ náá, bi ààgu etsɛɛtsɛ. Ye ɛ́ etɛɛ náá, bi nɛ gu yɛ. Bi nɛ gu ɛnyɔɛpe náá, ye tok nɛ etɛp etsal di dus tɔ etsɛɛtsɛ.<verse eid="1JN 2:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1JN 2:22"/>E di'enek, ɛzɛ di mot etsal? Ye ɛ́ mot di eke náá, Yezu tok Klisto ɔ. Nyɛ ɛ́ di mot mɛbhuka ɛ Klisto, nyɛ ɛpebyen Sɛɛg nɛ Mɔn e ɛwala wat. <verse eid="1JN 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1JN 2:23"/>Tin, mot di ebyen Mɔn ɔɔ, nyɛ tokapɛ nɛ ɛgwakel nɛ Zɛɛb Sɛɛg. Mot di emyaal Mɔn ɔɔ, nyɛ ɛ́ tɔ ɛgwakel nɛ Zɛɛb Sɛɛg.<verse eid="1JN 2:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1JN 2:24"/>Dum nɛ tɛp tak ɛ, bi di egoka nɛ ɛbaal mɛkpa mɛ tak tɔ elyem bin. Ye ɛ́ mɛkpa mɛ bi nagwak e mɛkɛn «tɔɔɔ» ɛ. Bi ɛbaal mɛkpa mɛ tak tɔ elyem bin ɔɔ, bi aadi ɛ́ sama wat nɛ Mɔn dɔɔ nɛ Zɛɛb Sɛɛg. <verse eid="1JN 2:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1JN 2:25"/>Beeka sa Klisto nakɛk bis ɛ: ye ɛ́ tsik na kɔm-kɔm.<verse eid="1JN 2:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1JN 2:26"/>Mɛ kwyal bin etɛp bak ɛ, kɔ ɛsu ɛ bot di esaŋ ɛkɔɔ bin ɔ. <verse eid="1JN 2:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1JN 2:27"/>Yɛ kabɛ biyɔ ɔ, Sisim na Dɛɛ ee bi nabela nɛ Klisto ɛ, ye ɛ́ tɔ len. Tin, bi tokapɛ nɛ gwyes náá, dhiiti mot baazɛlyo bin. Etɛɛ náá, Sisim na Dɛɛ ɛpelyaal bin esa djas. Tin, sa nyɛ di elyaal bin ɛ, ye ɛ́ etsɛɛtsɛ ye tok etsal. Dum nɛ tɛp tak, dika sama wat nɛ Klisto dáa Sisim na Dɛɛ nalyaal bin ɛ.<verse eid="1JN 2:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">Bɔɔ Zɛɛb</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1JN 2:28"/>Nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ bɔɔ bam, dika sama wat nɛ Klisto, étɛp mena needika nɛ ɛbwaalel e sok nyɛ aatuula ɛ. Ye ɛ́ aagoka náá, mena ɛzɛkɛgwyɛka nɛ syen e mis mɛ dwoo nyɛ aazyɛ ɛ́. <verse eid="1JN 2:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1JN 2:29"/>Tin, bi nɛ gu náá, Klisto ɛ mot epiki. É di'enek mot di esa etɛp epiki ɔ, nyɛ ɛ́ mɔɔ Zɛɛb.<verse eid="1JN 2:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1JN 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1JN 3"/>
  <para style="s">Bɔɔ Zɛɛb</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1JN 3:1"/>Beeka mbi kwyɛl Zɛɛb Sɛɛg di nɛ yɛ nɛ nena ɛ, mɛkwyɛla mɛ tak ɛ sa náá, mena djóoaa bɔɔ Zɛɛb. Tin, nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ menaka ɛ́ bɔn bɛ. Deenek, bot ɛ bɔs'ak nabɛ ɛ́ ààgu bis, dum nɛ tɛp tak ɛ bɛ di ààgu nyɛy Zɛɛb. <verse eid="1JN 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1JN 3:2"/>Bɛwɛn bam mɛ di ekwyɛl ɔ, mena mooka mos ɛ bɔɔ Zɛɛb. Tin, Zɛɛb dinaa ààpaalyaalka mena sa mena aadika djɛmɛn ɛ. Bela náá, mena nɛ guka náá, é ghɛŋ Klisto aatuula ɛ, mena aadika ɛ tyee wat nɛ nɛ. Deenek, etɛɛ náá, mena waabeeka nyɛ dáa nyɛ di ɛ. <verse eid="1JN 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1JN 3:3"/>Tin, bot djas di ewa kɔkɔ mbi yenek ɛbwaalel nɛ Klisto ɔ, tokapɛ si bhel mesyem. Tin, nyɛ moo ɛ́ Dɛɛ, dáa Klisto nyɛ ɛmet di Dɛɛ ɛ.<verse eid="1JN 3:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1JN 3:4"/>Bot djas di esa mesyem ɔ, nɛ baasa ɛbiyo. Etɛɛ náá, ɛsa mesyem ye ɛ́ ɛsa ɛzɛm. <verse eid="1JN 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1JN 3:5"/>Deenek, bi nɛ gu ɛnyɔɛpe náá, Yezu Klisto nazetuula étɛp ɛdis ɛ mesyem, nyɛ tok nɛ mesyem tɔ lɛ. <verse eid="1JN 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1JN 3:6"/>Tin, mot di kɛsama wat nɛ Yezu Klisto ɔ kat ɛsa mesyem. E di'enek, mot ɛ di sa mesyem ɔɔ, lyaal ɛ náá nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààbee nyɛ, ààkogu nyɛ gua.<verse eid="1JN 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1JN 3:7"/>Bɔɔ bam, sa bi ààbet náá mot diibal bin. Tin, mot di ekɛ tɔ epiki ɔ, nyɛ ɛ́ piki mot, dáa Yezu nyɛ ɛmet di piki ɛ. <verse eid="1JN 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1JN 3:8"/>Tin, mot di ekɛ tɔ ɛsyem ɔ, nyɛ ɛ́ mɔɔ dim mot mɛkɔŋ, etɛɛ náá, nyɛ nasyem ɛ e mɛkɛn mɛ bhwak. E di'enek, Yezu Mɔn Zɛɛb natuula ɛ́, étɛp ɛ ɛzɛpul embee mɛsa mɛ dim mot mɛkɔŋ. <verse eid="1JN 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1JN 3:9"/>Mot dinaa nyɛ moo ɛ́ tɛtɛ mɔɔ Zɛɛb ɔ, nyɛ kat ɛsyem, etɛɛ náá, tsik ɛ Zɛɛb moo ɛ́ tɔ lɛ. Dáa dinaa Zɛɛb ɛ Sɛɛg ɛ, yɛ ààgoka náá, nyɛ baakɛ tɔ mesyem. <verse eid="1JN 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1JN 3:10"/>Beeka sa di ewa mbɛk popoopwon pak bɔɔ Zɛɛb nɛ bɔɔ dim mot mɛkɔŋ ɔ: mot di ààkwyɛl mɔn nyɛɛg ɔ nɛghu ààkɛ tɔ epiki ɔ, nyɛ tok mɔɔ Zɛɛb.<verse eid="1JN 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1JN 3:11"/>Tin, beeka mɛlyo mɛ bi nagwak e mɛkɛn ɛ: djhookwyɛlelka pak'ena. <verse eid="1JN 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1JN 3:12"/>Sa mena ààdika dáa mot di edjóoaa Kayin ɛ, nyɛ nadi ɛ́ mɔɔ dim mot mɛkɔŋ, nyɛ naagó mɔn nyɛɛg. «Ha» étɛp yé nyɛ nagó nyɛ? Ye nabɛ ɛ́ etɛɛ náá, nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ mbee mɛsa. Tin, yii mɔn nyɛɛg nadi ɛ́ mɛsa mɛ epiki.<verse eid="1JN 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1JN 3:13"/>Bɔn nyɛɛg bam, sa biyɔ ààdjoka yɛ bɛ náá bot ɛ bɔs'ak ɛpebhina bin ɔɔ. <verse eid="1JN 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1JN 3:14"/>Tin, mena nɛ guka náá, mena eezedus tɔ ɛsyee, mena moo ɛ́ tɔ tsik. Mena nɛ guka yɛ etɛɛ náá, mena nɛ kwyɛlka bɔn nyɛɛg bena. Deenek, mot di ààdi tɔ kwyɛl ɔ, nyɛ ɛ́ si ghwyil ɛsyee. <verse eid="1JN 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1JN 3:15"/>Tin, mot di ebhina mɔn nyɛɛg ɔ, nyɛ ɛ́ dáa mot di gó bot ɔ. Deenek, bi nɛ gu náá, bot ɛ di egó bot ɔ, tok nɛ ghwyil ɛbela tsik na kɔm-kɔm.<verse eid="1JN 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1JN 3:16"/>Beeka dáa mena di egu tyee mena di egoka nɛ ɛkwyɛl bɔɔ bɛsɔ bina ɛ: Yezu Klisto naadjɛ tsik'ɛ kɔ ɛsu ɛ lena. Deenek, ye goka ɛ́ náá, menabɛlka pe baadjɛ tsik'enaka étɛp bɔn nyɛɛg bena. <verse eid="1JN 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1JN 3:17"/>Tin, mot ɛdi nɛ mɛvu mɛ bɔs'ak, da nyɛ ɛbee mɔn nyɛɛg ezuk, nyɛ ààgek nyɛ ghoŋ ɔ, nyɛ aake náá, nyɛ nɛ kwyɛl Zɛɛb dáa? <verse eid="1JN 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1JN 3:18"/>Bɔɔ bam, sa mɛkwyɛla mɛ mena di ekwyɛlaka ɛ ààdi yii lɛŋ toto, ye goka ɛ́ mena lyaal tɛtɛ mɛkwyɛla tɔ esesɛɛ benaka.<verse eid="1JN 3:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ɛbwaalel e mis ɛ Zɛɛb</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1JN 3:19"/>Beeka dáa mena aaguka náá, menaka ɛ́ bot ɛ etsɛɛtsɛ ɛ. Beeka dáa elyem binaka aasila e mis ɛ Zɛɛb ɛ. <verse eid="1JN 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1JN 3:20"/>Ye nakoozodi náá, elyem bina ɛdjɛ mena mɛbɛ, mena nɛ guka náá, Zɛɛb eedhaa elyem bina nɛ mɛbɔk, nyɛ nɛ gu etɛp djas. <verse eid="1JN 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1JN 3:21"/>Tin, bɔn nyɛɛg bam mɛ di ekwyɛl ɔ, yɛ bɛ náá elyem bina aapadjɛ mena mɛbɛ ɔɔ, deenek, mena ɛ nɛ ghwyil ɛ di nɛ ɛbwaalel nɛ Zɛɛb. <verse eid="1JN 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1JN 3:22"/>E di'enek, nyɛ nɛ djɛ mena esa djas ee mena di ewaab nɛ nɛ ɛ, etɛɛ náá, mena nɛ looba nɛ mɛtiŋ mɛ, mena nɛ sa esa nyɛ di emyaala nɛ ye ɛ́. <verse eid="1JN 3:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1JN 3:23"/>Beeka ɛtsiŋ ɛ nyɛ nadjɛ mena ɛ, ye ɛ́ náá: mena goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛdum koŋ nɛ din ɛ mɔn'ɛ Yezu Klisto, da mena ɛ kwyɛlelka pak'enaka dáa Klisto nalɛɛ nɛ mena ɛ. <verse eid="1JN 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1JN 3:24"/>Tin, mot di elooba nɛ mɛtiŋ ɛ Zɛɛb ɔ, nyɛ kɛ ɛ́ sama wat nɛ Zɛɛb ɛ, tin, Zɛɛb ɛ tɔ lɛ. Beea dáa mena di guka náá Zɛɛb ɛ tɔ lena ɛ: ye ɛ́ kɔ ɛsu ɛ Sisim na Dɛɛ ee nyɛ djɛ mena ɛ.<verse eid="1JN 3:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1JN 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1JN 4"/>
  <para style="s">Sisim Zɛɛb nɛ sisim mot mɛbhuka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1JN 4:1"/>Bɔn nyɛɛg bam mɛ di ekwyɛl ɔ, sa mot ààmyaal mbi mɛkpa mɛ esisim mbɛs di ewyis tɔ enuub e bot ɛ. Tin, ye goka ɛ́ bi ɛpokosiiza etɛp e tak ɛnyɔɛpe nɛghu ye ɛ́ mɛkpa mɛ dus pɛ daa Zɛɛb ɛ. Etɛɛ náá, bɛtɛ nɛ embee bɛgoolel ɛ mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb eezelwood kɔ ɛko ɛ bɔs. <verse eid="1JN 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1JN 4:2"/>Beeka dáa bi aagu náá, ye ɛ́ Sisim Zɛɛb ɛ: esisim djas di emyaal náá, Yezu Klisto mot naazyɛ kɔ bɔs dáa bot djas ɔ, sisim tak ɛ yii Zɛɛb. <verse eid="1JN 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1JN 4:3"/>Deenek, sisim djas di ààmyaal Yezu ɔ, ye tok Sisim ɛ Zɛɛb. Tin, ye ɛ́ sisim mot swaka ɛ Klisto ee bi nagwak náá ye ɛpezyɛ ɛ́. Ye moo ɛ́ kɔ ɛko ɛ bɔs.<verse eid="1JN 4:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1JN 4:4"/>Biyɔ bɔɔ bam, bi ɛ bot ɛ mbyak'ɛ Zɛɛb. Tin, bi naazekwak embee bɛgoolel mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb binɔk, etɛɛ náá, Sisim na Dɛɛ di tɔ len ɛ nɛ bwala dhaa esisim bot ɛ bɔs'ak. <verse eid="1JN 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1JN 4:5"/>Deenek, bembee bɛngoolel ɛ mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb binɔk ɛ bot ɛ bɔs'ak. Tin, bɛ zobaalii ɛ etɛp e bɔs'ak. Deenek, bot ɛ bɔs'ak nɛ gwak sa bɛ di elii ɛ. <verse eid="1JN 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1JN 4:6"/>Tin, yɛ kabɛ bisɔ, bis ɛ bɔɔ ɛ Zɛɛb. Deenek, mot di egu Zɛɛb ɔ, nɛ gwak bis. Mot di ààgu Zɛɛb ɔ, ààgwak bis. Ye ɛ́ deenek ɛ bot aawa mbɛk pak Sisim etsɛɛtsɛ nɛ sisim mɛkɔŋ.<verse eid="1JN 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Zɛɛb ɛ́ mɛkwyɛla</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1JN 4:7"/>Bɛwɛn bam mɛ di ekwyɛl ɔ, djhookwyɛlaka pak'enaka, etɛɛ náá, kwyɛl dus pɛ daa Zɛɛb. Deenek, mot di ekwyɛl bot djas ɛ, mɔɔ Zɛɛb. Deenek, nyɛ nɛ gu Zɛɛb. <verse eid="1JN 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1JN 4:8"/>Tin, mot di ààdi tɔ kwyɛl ɔ, nyɛ ààgu Zɛɛb. Etɛɛ náá, Zɛɛb ɛ kwyɛl. <verse eid="1JN 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1JN 4:9"/>Beeka dáa Zɛɛb di elyaal náá, nyɛ nɛ kwyɛl mena ɛ. Nyɛ naadhis Sɛɛŋɛlɛ mɔn'ɛ kɔ ɛko ɛ bɔs, étɛp bot neebela tɛtɛ tsik kɔ ɛsu ɛ lɛ. <verse eid="1JN 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1JN 4:10"/>Beeka sa di edjóoaa kwyɛl ɛ. Ye tok náá, menabɛlka ɛ nakwyɛl Zɛɛb. Ye ɛ́ nyɛ ɛ́ nakwyɛl mena, nyɛ bokadhis mɔn'ɛ. Nyɛ nadhis nyɛ ɛ́, nyɛ neezɛka nyel'ɛ e buwa étɛp ɛpelak mesyem mena.<verse eid="1JN 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1JN 4:11"/>Bɛwɛn bam, dáa dinaa, Zɛɛb nakwyɛlka mena deenek ɛ, mena gokaka ɛ nɛ kwyɛlelka pak'enaka. <verse eid="1JN 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1JN 4:12"/>Mot ngɔt dinaa ààpaabee Zɛɛb sok. Mena dika nɛ mɛkwyɛla pak'enaka ɔɔ, Zɛɛb ɛ tɔ lena. Tin, mɛkwyɛla mɛ ɛpenyen popoopwon tɔ lena. <verse eid="1JN 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1JN 4:13"/>Beea dáa mena di egoka nɛ ɛgu náá, Zɛɛb ɛ sama wat nɛ nena ɛ, nɛ náá, nyɛ ɛ́ tɔ lena ɛ: nyɛ naadjɛ mena Sisim yɛ. <verse eid="1JN 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1JN 4:14"/>Bis naabee, ye ɛ́ bis di ebaŋa náá: Zɛɛb Sɛɛg naadhis mɔn'ɛ dáa Mɛtsik-bot kɔ ɛko ɛ bɔs. <verse eid="1JN 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1JN 4:15"/>Deenek, mot ɛ myaal é mis mɛ bot náá, Yezu ɛ́ Mɔn Zɛɛb ɔɔ, Zɛɛb aadi ɛ́ sama wat nɛ nɛ, mot tak aadi ɛ́ sama nɛ Zɛɛb. <verse eid="1JN 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1JN 4:16"/>Yɛ kabɛ bisɔ ɔ, bis nɛ gu, tin, bis nɛ myaal náá, Zɛɛb nɛ kwyɛl bis. Zɛɛb ɛ kwyɛl, mot di ekɛ tɔ kwyɛl ɔ, mot tak ɛ sama wat nɛ Zɛɛb, deenek, Zɛɛb ɛ sama wat nɛ nɛ.<verse eid="1JN 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1JN 4:17"/>Kwyɛl ɛ́ di tɔ lena ɛnyɔɛpe ɔɔ, mena naakwaabem ba dwoo epɛɛ. Mena di ààkabaabem ba ɛ etɛɛ náá, tsik'ena kɔ bɔs'ak nɔŋel ɛ nɛ ye ɛ́ Yezu Klisto. <verse eid="1JN 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1JN 4:18"/>Ye tok nɛ bwoo tɔ kwyɛl, tɛtɛ kwyɛl nɛ dis bwoo. Etɛɛ náá, mot dyeebadi nɛ bwoo ɛ, é ghɛŋ nyɛ di tɔ bhwood feŋ ɛ. Mot di nɛ bwoo ɔ, nyɛ ààgu sa di edjóoaa tɛtɛ kwyɛl ɛ.<verse eid="1JN 4:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1JN 4:19"/>Yɛ kabɛ menabɛlka ɔ, mena kwyɛlka ɛ, etɛɛ náá, Zɛɛb ɛ naleekan ɛkwyɛlka mena sok. <verse eid="1JN 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1JN 4:20"/>Deenek, mot ɛ di eke náá: «Mɛ nɛ kwyɛl Zɛɛb» da nyɛ bhina mɔn nyɛɛg ɔ, nyɛ ɛ́ mot etsal. Tin, mot ɛ di ààkwyɛl sɔ mot ɔ, mot nyɛ di bee ɔ, nyɛ tok nɛ ghwyil ɛkwyɛl Zɛɛb mot nyɛ di ààbee ɔ. <verse eid="1JN 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1JN 4:21"/>Gwakeka ɛtiŋ ɛ Klisto nadjɛ mena ɛ: mot di ekwyɛl Zɛɛb ɔ, goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛbaakwyɛl mɔn nyɛɛg.<verse eid="1JN 4:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1JN 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1JN 5"/>
  <para style="s">Eghɛŋ bina kɔ ɛko ɛ bɔs</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1JN 5:1"/>Mot di emyaal náá, Yezu ɛ Klisto. Mot tak ɛ mɔn Zɛɛb. Tin, mot di ekwyɛl Zɛɛb Sɛɛg ɔ, baakwyɛl ɛ dɔɔ nɛ mɔn'ɛ. <verse eid="1JN 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1JN 5:2"/>Beeka dáa mena di egoka nɛ gu náá, mena nɛ kwyɛl bɔɔ Zɛɛb ɛ. Ye ɛ́ é ghɛŋ mena di ekwyɛl Zɛɛb nɛ ɛbaal mɛtiŋ mɛ ɛ. <verse eid="1JN 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1JN 5:3"/>Etɛɛ náá, ɛkwyɛl ɛ Zɛɛb ɛ, ɛlooba nɛ mɛtiŋ mɛ. E di'enek, mɛtiŋ mɛ tak tok nɛ mezuk, <verse eid="1JN 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1JN 5:4"/>etɛɛ náá, bɔɔ Zɛɛb djas ɛ bot ɛ zekwak esa e bɔs'ak ɔ. Tin, sa di esa náá, bot kwak esa e bɔs'ak ɛ, ye ɛ́ ɛdum ɛ koŋ ɛ lena nɛ Zɛɛb. <verse eid="1JN 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1JN 5:5"/>Ɛzɛ aakwak esa e bɔs'ak? Ye ɛ́ mot di nɛ ɛmyaal náá, Yezu ɛ́ Mɔn Zɛɛb ɔ.<verse eid="1JN 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Etɛp ee nabaŋaaa dum nɛ Yezu Klisto ɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1JN 5:6"/>Yezu Klisto ɛ́ mot natuula kɔ bɔs'ak ɔ, nyɛ naani tɔ mɛdii ɛ e sok nyɛ nadi eduwa Zɛɛb ɛ. Ghiya yɛ naasee e ɛsyee ɛ lɛ. Nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààzyɛ nɛ mɛdii nɛ mɛdii toto, nyɛ nabaazyɛ ɛ́ nɛ ghiya. Tin, Sisim na Dɛɛ ɛpelɛɛ náá, ye ɛ́ tsɛɛtsɛ, etɛɛ náá, Sisim ɛ etsɛɛtsɛ. <verse eid="1JN 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1JN 5:7"/>Ye ɛ́ nɛ bɛtyaasɛs ɛlɛl: <verse eid="1JN 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1JN 5:8"/>Ye ɛ́ Sisim na Dɛɛ, mɛdii zɛnɔɔ ghiya. Deenek, bɔɔ djas bɛlɛl nɛ gwakel. <verse eid="1JN 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1JN 5:9"/>Mena nɛ myaalka etɛp ee bot di ekaada mena ɛ, ghuna yii Zɛɛb di ebaŋa bot ɛ, ye ɛ́ nɛ boo mɛgham. Ye ɛ́ sa nyɛ nabaŋa bot dum nɛ Mɔn'ɛ ɛ.<verse eid="1JN 5:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1JN 5:10"/>Mot di edum koŋ nɛ Mɔn Zɛɛb ɔ, mot tak ɛ nɛ gu etsɛɛtsɛ etɛp nakaadaa nyɛ ɛ́ tɔ lyem. Tin, mot di ààdum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɔ, bee ɛ náá, Zɛɛb ɛ mot etsal, etɛɛ náá, nyɛ ààmyaal etɛp Zɛɛb nakaada bot dum nɛ Mɔn'ɛ ɛ. <verse eid="1JN 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1JN 5:11"/>Beea lɛŋ nakaadaa mena ɛ: Zɛɛb naadjɛ mena tsik na kɔm-kɔm, tsik tak ɛ tɔ Mɔn'ɛ. <verse eid="1JN 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1JN 5:12"/>Mot di ekɛ sama wat nɛ Mɔn ɔ, nyɛ nɛ tsik tak. Tin, mot di ààkɛ sama wat nɛ Mɔn Zɛɛb ɔ, nyɛ tok nɛ tsik tak.<verse eid="1JN 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Tsik na kɔm-kɔm</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1JN 5:13"/>Mɛ kwyal bin etɛp bak ɛ étɛp bi neegu náá, bi ɛ nɛ tsik na kɔm-kɔm, biyɔ bot ɛ di edum koŋ nɛ Mɔn Zɛɛb ɔ. <verse eid="1JN 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1JN 5:14"/>Ɛbwaalel ɛ mena dika nɛ yɛ nɛ nɛ ɛ, ye ɛ́ náá: e sok mena di ewaab sonok tɔ ɛkwosak ɛ lɛ ɛ, nyɛ waagwak mena. <verse eid="1JN 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1JN 5:15"/>Ye goka ɛ, mena guka náá, Zɛɛb nɛ gwak mendjaala mena. Mena nɛ baamyaal nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ náá, mena waabelaka sa mena di ewaab nɛ nɛ ɛ.<verse eid="1JN 5:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1JN 5:16"/>Tin, mot ɛ bee mɔn nyɛɛg esa mesyem dinaa, yɛ aanàkɛswala nɛ nɛ ɛsyee ɔ, nyɛ goka ɛ́ nyɛ djaala Zɛɛb étɛp mɔn nyɛɛg'enɔk. E di'enek, Zɛɛb ɛ waadjɛ tsik nɛ mɔn nyɛɛg tak. Yenek ɛ, étɛp bot ɛ di náá mesyem aanàkɛswala nɛ nɔɔ ɛsyee ɔ. Tin, ye ɛ́ nɛ syem wat di ekɛswala nɛ ɛsyee, ye tok etɛp mbi yenek syem mɛ di eke náá, bɛ djaala nɛ Zɛɛb. <verse eid="1JN 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1JN 5:17"/>Embee mɛsa djas ɛ mesyem, tin, tɔ mesyem menek djas, ye ɛ́ nɛ mesyem mɛ di náá yɛ aanàkɛswala nɛ ɛsyee ɛ.<verse eid="1JN 5:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1JN 5:18"/>Mena nɛ guka náá, mot di náá, nyɛ ɛ́ mɔɔ Zɛɛb nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ ɔ, nyɛ tok nɛ ghwyil ɛ baasesyem. Etɛɛ náá, Mɔn Zɛɛb ɛpebaal nyɛ, e di'enek, dim mot mɛkɔŋ tok nɛ ghwyil kɔ lɛ. <verse eid="1JN 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1JN 5:19"/>Mena nɛ guka náá, menaka ɛ́ bɔn Zɛɛb, deenek, bɔs'ak djas kɛ ɛ́ si bhel dim mot mɛkɔŋ. <verse eid="1JN 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1JN 5:20"/>Tin, mena nɛ guka náá, Mɔn Zɛɛb eezezyɛ, deenek nyɛ eedjɛ mena mɛtsɛlal étɛp mena neeguka tɛtɛ Zɛɛb. Deenek menaka ɛ́ sama wat nɛ tɛtɛ Zɛɛb kɔ ɛsu ɛ Mɔn'ɛ Yezu Klisto. Ye ɛ́ nyɛy ɛdi Zɛɛb nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ, ye ɛ́ nyɛy ɛdi tsik na kɔm-kɔm.<verse eid="1JN 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1JN 5:21"/>Bɔɔ bam, kyeeka bɛzɛɛb ɛ naghisɛ!<verse eid="1JN 5:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1JN 5"/>
</usx>
